# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Nails by Alynna web app — local development. Copy to `.env` (git-ignored).
# The app always calls the API on its own origin (/api). In development Vite proxies
# /api to the backend below; in production the Cloudflare Worker proxies it.
# Nothing here is shipped to browsers unless prefixed with VITE_ (none are secrets).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Backend used by the Vite dev server proxy (backend `yarn dev` listens on 8787).
VITE_API_PROXY=http://127.0.0.1:8787
